   "localStart": 0.012,
   "localDuration": 8.394,
   "text": "第七种是 append system prompt，通过 CLI flag 在调用时追加一段内容到 system prompt 后面。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-2",
   "localStart": 8.406,
   "localDuration": 6.39,
   "text": "它跟 output styles 的区别是：output styles 是替换，append 是叠加。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-3",
   "localStart": 14.996,
   "localDuration": 3.859,
   "text": "所以它不会破坏默认人设，只是在后面加东西。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-4",
   "localStart": 19.02,
   "localDuration": 6.133,
   "text": "但 append system prompt 有一个特别反直觉的限制——**边际递减。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-5",
   "localStart": 25.153,
   "localDuration": 6.561,
   "text": "** 官方原话是：你给的指令越多，Claude 遵循得越不严格，尤其是指令之间有矛盾的时候。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-6",
   "localStart": 31.872,
   "localDuration": 3.623,
   "text": "这话翻译过来就是：append 不是越多越好。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-7",
   "localStart": 35.495,
   "localDuration": 5.356,
   "text": "到某个阈值，你加的指令开始互相打架，Claude 干脆都不严格执行。"
  }
 ]
